  "contracts": [
    "iommu_parent bool0400 default false, requires held MSI/PME/inventory guards before registration.",
    "Provider acquired after inventory before PCI publication; absent/stopped/device-less successful owner rejected.",
    "Associated cleanup removes PCI/MSI and OF map before provider stop, then releases availability and restores the host/reset/power. Any failure preserves owners and module pin; retry does not rescan or double release.",
    "dart-release refuses while the OF association owner exists and directs action=cleanup.",
    "iommu getter is locked and reports requested/ready/held/owner/available/mapped/observed/map_checked/session_error. map_checked is last OF/core observation of a live held bus, not private SID or DMA readback.",
    "Older getter formats and unattached modes preserved."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No physical boot, module load, IRQ delivery, DMA translation, Wi-Fi, gauge or charging proof in this slice.",
